      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\n<div class=\"february-issue-banner\">\n    <div class=\"february-banner-badge\">🔔 14 Official Languages Edition — Part 3</div>\n    <div class=\"february-banner-content\">\n        <h4>Vol. 2027.02 — Master Editorial Hub (Part 3)</h4>\n        <p>Welcome to Part 3 of our master editorial hub for beginner language learners (CEFR A0–A1 / A2). In this February edition, we explore decision-making, commerce, memory, feelings, social interactions, writing & reading, resource allocation, play, agreement, and transmission across all 14 official languages!</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #ecfdf5; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#059669;\">🌐 14 Official Languages Navigation Hub (Part 3)</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:#064e3b; margin-bottom:1.25rem;\">Select any target language below to explore its deep-dive Part 3 guide with rich phrase examples, nuances, and usages:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-en.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇧 English Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-fr.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇫🇷 French Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-it.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇮🇹 Italian Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-ru.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇷🇺 Russian Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-el.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇷 Greek Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-tt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Tatar Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-ba.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Bashkir Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-br.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Breton Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-pt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇵🇹 Portuguese Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-es.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇪🇸 Spanish Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-de.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇩🇪 German Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-hy.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇦🇲 Armenian Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-ka.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇪 Georgian Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-3-cv.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Chuvash Guide (Pt. 3) ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"verb-map-container\">\n    <h3 class=\"verb-map-title\">🗺️ The 10 Essential Core Verbs (Part 3 Focus)</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem; color:#064e3b;\">These 10 essential verb clusters power everyday decisions, commerce, cognition, emotions, and interactions across all 14 official languages:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"verb-map-grid\">\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>1. Choose & Buy & Pay</strong> — Selection, shopping, transactions by card/cash.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>2. Remember & Forget</strong> — Memory retention, recalling names & items.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>3. Feel</strong> — Expressing feelings, mood, cold/warmth, tiredness.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>4. Meet</strong> — Social gatherings, meeting friends, introductions.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>5. Decide</strong> — Choice & intentions ('decide to do' / 'decide on'; note: solve a problem).</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>6. Write & Read & Type</strong> — Literacy, messages, reading books, typing text.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>7. Spend & Waste</strong> — Resource management with time and money.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>8. Play (all variations)</strong> — Sports, board games, musical instruments, roles.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>9. Agree & Disagree</strong> — Alignment, consensus, expressing different views.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>10. Send & Get</strong> — Sending messages, receiving items, arriving at places.</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n"
    }
